Applies feature state changes and removals in the order they were called, so
a frame that removes one feature's state and sets another's draws both
(https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/1706). This carries
the upstream pull request in place of our own fix, which let a removal win
over a change queued for the same frame. Temporary: drop this patch when the
submodule moves to a core that includes the pull request.
Upstream: https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native/pull/4835 at 31b7e856

